title: InClassroom
position: 28,-202
---
<<ChangeSceneTo Camera Classroom>>
<<wait 1>>
That afternoon, a sudden wave of acute stomach pain hit you without warning.
It felt as though someone were twisting your insides over and over again; 
You told yourself that if you stayed quiet and endured it, it would eventually pass.
Then she leaned closer.
<<Act Girl GirlSad_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Girl: You look pale. Are you feeling sick?
<<HideAll>>
<<Act Boy BoySad_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Boy: It's nothing… probably just something I ate.
<<HideAll>>
<<Act Girl GirlSad_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Girl: That's not “nothing.” Wait here—I'll get you some medicine.
<<HideAll>>
<<Act Boy BoySad_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Boy: You really don't have to…
<<HideAll>>
<<wait 1>>
(A few moments later.)

<<Act Medicine medicine 0.5 0.5 white 0.3>>
<<wait 1>>
<<HideAll>>
<<wait 0.5>>
<<Act Girl GirlNormal_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Girl: Here. The medicine and some water. Drink slowly.
<<HideAll>>
<<Act Boy boyNormal_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Boy: …Thank you.
<<HideAll>>
<<Act Girl GirlNormal_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Girl: If it still hurts, tell the teacher. I'll walk you to the infirmary.
<<HideAll>>
<<Act Boy boyNormal_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Boy: It's okay. I'm better now.
<<HideAll>>
<<Act Girl GirlSad_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Girl: You always pretend you're fine.
<<HideAll>>
<<Act Boy BoySad_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Boy: …Yeah.
<<HideAll>>

You held onto that moment quietly.
So this was what it felt like to be noticed.
And from that day on, she was no longer just another classmate in your life.
<<jump Breakfast>>
