The lights dim as you enter the escape room.
Clues scatter the walls; shadows stretch unnaturally across the floor.
Just as you're piecing together a solution,
<<ShowItem Ghost>>
<<Act Ghost Ghost 0.5 0.3 grey 0.6>>
a figure in a crimson robe suddenly emerges from the darkness.
<<wait 1>>
<<HideAll>>
<<ShowItem Ghost>>
<<Act Girl GirlScared2_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
Girl: !!!
She gasps.
<<wait 0.5>>
<<HideAll>>
In that split second, you decide to —
-> Stand Between Her and the Apparition
    <<set $affection += 1>>
    Your body moves before your fear can catch up.
    <<Act Boy BoyAngry2_0 0.5 0.3 white 0.6>>
    Boy: Stay behind me.
    <<HideAll>>
