title: Shopping
position: -222,175
---
<<set $affection += 1>>
<<set $sacrifice += 1>>
You've never really enjoyed shopping.
But she lights up the moment you step into the busy streets, pulling you from store to store.
Hours pass.
You find yourself trailing slightly behind, carrying her bags, nodding at things you don't quite understand.
It's not your idea of fun,
But watching her smile makes it harder to care.
<<jump SchoolGate_2>>
