title: HappyEnding_MutualGrowth
position: -186,584
---
<<ChangeSceneTo Camera HappyEnding>>
<<wait 1>>
She says yes.
And just like that, you become a couple.
There are countless good days. 
But love is not made only of gentle moments.
Sometimes,arguments arise.
You have different opinions, different ways of expressing yourselves.
Conflicts do not disappear.
But they become conversations instead of cracks.
You know fighting does not mean the absence of love.
Your story continues.
===

title: BadEnding_Sacrifice
position: 30,578
---
<<ChangeSceneTo Camera BadEnding>>
<<wait 1>>
She accepts your confession and you become a couple.
For a while, everything feels bright.
But the brightness does not last.
Disagreements grow more frequent.
And each time, you choose to step back.
You tell yourself that compromise is what makes relationships endure.
That sacrifice is proof of love.
But is it?
Gradually, she grows used to your silence after arguments,used to waiting for you to give in.
Love begins to resemble a fragile glass bottle.
Every unspoken frustration adds another drop of water.
Until one day, without warning, it cracks.
You do not know what she truly felt in the end.
But you once loved her sincerely.
And perhaps, that has to be enough.

===

title: BadEnding_BadTiming
position: 266,569
---
Girl: Oh…
She pauses.
Girl: I care about you a lot too. But I'm not sure if I'm ready for a relationship right now.
There is hesitation in her eyes.
After a moment, she says she wants to focus on her studies.
She hopes you can remain friends.
<<ChangeSceneTo Camera BadEnding>>
<<wait 1>>
Life moves forward.
After graduation, you attend universities in different cities.
Messages become occasional.
Sometimes, you still think of her.
Some stories do not end in heartbreak.
They simply fade.

